# Disposable fixture Brains and the evidence runs beside them (never committed).
/.preview/
# Artifact bytes an agent's `read_artifact` writes into the checkout.
/.mentis-artifacts/
# What a round's own checks write beside the checkout: suite logs, the preview
# server's output, product-path logs and pytest basetemps. They are evidence, so
# they are kept where they were written and their counts are recorded in the
# round's report -- which Mentis holds as an artifact, not this repository.
/.pytest-*.log
/.ui-suite-*.log
/.preview-*.log
/.product-path-*.log
/.test-integrated-*/
/INTEGRATION-REPORT-*.md

# Rust build output
/target/
